#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.from_local_df.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.from\\_local\\_df"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:1 of
msgid "Create a LiteFrame from a local pandas DataFrame or similar object."
msgstr "从本地 pandas DataFrame 或类似对象创建 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:3 of
msgid ""
"Column names are normalized to lowercase to make internal storage case-"
"insensitive, and duplicate names after normalization raise a "
"``ValueError``. Dtypes are inferred from the input."
msgstr ""
"列名被规范化为小写以使内部存储不区分大小写，规范化后的重复名称会引发 ``"
"ValueError``。数据类型从输入中推断。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.from_local_df.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:7 of
msgid ""
"Local DataFrame to wrap. Must have a ``columns`` attribute and support "
"``.dtypes`` if not a pandas DataFrame."
msgstr ""
"要包装的本地 DataFrame。如果不是 pandas DataFrame，则必须具有 ``columns``"
" 属性并支持 ``.dtypes``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:10 of
msgid ""
"Desired chunk size for the tiled result. If None, a default is chosen by "
"the backend."
msgstr "所需分块结果的块大小。如果为 None，则由后端选择默认值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:13 of
msgid ""
"Whether the data should be placed on GPU. If None, the backend default is"
" used."
msgstr "数据是否应放置在 GPU 上。如果为 None，则使用后端默认值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:16 of
msgid ""
"Session to use for execution. If None, the default session is used when "
"available."
msgstr "用于执行的会话。如果为 None，则在可用时使用默认会话。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:19 of
msgid ""
"Index type for the resulting LiteFrame. If None, a default is chosen by "
"the backend."
msgstr "结果 LiteFrame 的索引类型。如果为 None，则由后端选择默认值。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.from_local_df.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:23 of
msgid ""
"A lazy LiteFrame with Arrow dtypes wrapping the local data. Call "
"``.execute()`` to materialize the results."
msgstr ""
"一个具有 Arrow 数据类型的惰性 LiteFrame，包装本地数据。调用 ``.execute()`"
"` 来实例化结果。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.from_local_df.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:29 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.from_tensor`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:30 of
msgid "Create a LiteFrame from a MaxFrame tensor."
msgstr "从 MaxFrame 张量创建 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:32 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.from_local.from_local_df:33 of
msgid "Construct a LiteFrame from dict, DataFrame, or tensor."
msgstr "从字典、DataFrame 或张量构建 LiteFrame。"

